          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "أثار (athāra) is built on the native Arabic root th-w-r, \"to rise up, to be stirred\" (Lane). It is Form IV, to stir up: to raise dust, and so to raise feelings or a question."
